        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūbabala bashilikale",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūbapelanīla hangī a Baisilaeli, hūna ūnsoosela ū Daūdi kūlwa nguno yabo; ūng'wīla, “Jaga ūkababale a banhū ba Isilaeli na a ba Yuda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Daūdi ūng'wīla ū Yoabu na a bataale ba mabità ga bashilikale abo walī nabo; ūng'wīla, “Jaga ūkūbītaga pye a hose ū mu ng'anda ja Baisilaeli, kwandīja Dani kūshisha Beeli-sheba, muje ng'ūbabala a bashilikale, nabamane ū wingī wabo balī banga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yoabu ūnshokeja ū ntemi, “Ū SEEBA Mulungu wako ni abongejage a bashilikale ng'hangala magana na magana; na a miso ga ng'wa baba būgonzo ū ntemi gagūbone ū mhayo gwenūyū! Ī gīsī ng'hana īlīho nguno kī ī ya kūng'wenheleja nose ū baba būgonzo ū ntemi akoobe kwīta mhayo gūlī gīko?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ntemi ūtūmamīla nguzu ū mu kūng'wīla ū Yoabu na a bataale ba mabità. Na lūūlū bīnga ū kū būtongi wa ntemi, būja ū kūbabala a bashilikale ba mu sī ya Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būgūkīla ū mongo gwa Yolodani būūkandīja Aloeli, dakama ya nzengo gwalī mu sī ya ntubīlo, hūna būbīta hose pye ū mu Gadi, būūkashika Yazeeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama būlola Gileadi na kū sī ya Tatimu-hodishi; būbīta Dani-yaani, hanuma būtula kuluba bajile Sidoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū kwenūko būja Tulo, kū ng'hambī ya bashilikale na kū mizengo ya Bahīvī na Bakanaani. Aho bīnga ū kwenūko būūkamalīīgīja Beeli-sheba kwitogolo lya Negevu ya Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahayūmala ū kwībītīla pyī ī sī būshoka Yelusalemu; ū lūgendo ū lose lūbasola myeji kenda na shikū makūmi abīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoabu wiza ūng'winha ū ntemi ī lisaabu lya bashilikale: Ū mu Isilaeli dūhū baalīmo bashilikale shihūmbī magana anaane, abo baalī na nguzu ja kūdūla kūdima shilanga;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shilanga:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, lūshū.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ū mu Yuda baalīmo bashilikale shihūmbī magana atanò.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūwitegeleja būhūbi bokwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi aho wamala kūbabala a bashilikale yandya kūnkoya ī ng'holò yakwe, ūnomba ū SEEBA alīhaya, “Naahūbile no ū kwīta ū mhayo gwenūyo. Nalīkwikūmbīlīja SEEBA ūwīnje ū būkenaagūji wa ntūmami wako; nītile mhayo gwa nyachilū no!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha ntondo yaho ī dilū aho ataalī kūfuma ū Daūdi, mhayo go ng'wa Seba gūng'wizīīla ū ng'hangi Gadi, ūyo walī mmona o ng'wa Daūdi; gūhaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jaga ūkang'wīle ū Daūdi, ‘Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, Nalīkwinha mihayo idatū ūsole gūmò gwaho, ūniwīle nakwītīle īyo natogilwe kūkwītīla.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Gadi ūja ū kūlī Daūdi ūūkang'wīla, “Ūlīzunya ībize ho myaka mpungatī ya nzala ū mu sī yako? Nūūlū līkwizīīle ikanza lya kūbapeela banishi bako bakūkūkūūbīlījaga kūshisha myeji idatū ībīte? Nūūlū ihūūya lyīgwīle ī sī yako ikanza lya shikū idatū? Alilūūlū, iganikage ūninhe ū būlamuji wako nantwaalīle ūyo wanitūmaga!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūng'wīla ū Gadi, “Nalī mu makoye madito no ī haha; hambū hambū tūgwe mu makono ga ng'wa SEEBA, nguno ū ng'wene ī shigongo shakwe shilī shitaale. Yaya ū kūnileka nagwe mu makono ga banhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū SEEBA ūtūma ihūūya ū mu sī ya Isilaeli, kwandīja lūshikū lwenūlo kūshisha ī likanza īlo lyalī līhelilwe; ū kūfuma ī Dani kūshika Beeli-sheba būcha banhū shihūmbī makūmi mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū malaika aho waagūgoloola ū nkono gwakwe gīkī īītūle nī Yelusalemu, ū SEEBA ūsaatwa no kūlwa nguno ya būkenaagūji wenūbo, ūng'wīla ū malaika ūyo wababūlagaga a banhū, “Wigejaga lūūlū! Gwichage ū nkono gwako.” Ī likanza lyenīlo ū malaika akasangwa washika ha lūbūūga lwa kūtūlīla, lwa ng'wa Alauna ūmò wa Bayebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi aho wamona ū malaika ūyo wababūlagaga a banhū, ūng'wīla ū SEEBA, “Ū nene h'ūyo nalī ng'hūbi kūlwa būkenaagūji wane, al'a banhū aba, abo balī ng'holo jako, a bene baahūbile mhayo kī? Ū nkono gwako ni gūnigwīlage nene hamò na kaya yane!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūzenga ng'walīlo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwenūo ū Gadi ūja ū kūlī Daūdi ūūkang'wīla, “Būūkaga ūje ūkanzegele ng'walīlo ū SEEBA a ha lūbūūga lwa kūtūlīla ū lwa ng'wa Alauna ū Nyebusi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana ū Daūdi ūja koi gīt'ūmo SEEBA akalagīīlīla mu nzīla ya ng'wa Gadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Alauna aho waponya a miso ūmona ū ntemi aliza ha ng'wakwe na banhū bakwe, ūfuma hanze kūnsūng'wanha, ūshika ūntugīja mazwi ū ntemi winama kūshisha ū būshū būkuumya hasī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Alauna ūbūūja, “Ni mhayo kī ūyo gwang'wenha ha ng'wane ū baba būgonzo ū ntemi?” Ū ntemi ūshosha, “Niza kūlūgūla ū lūbūūga lwako lwa kūtūlīla, nazenge ho ng'walīlo kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA, līhangījiwe ī lihūūya ū kūbamala a banhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Alauna ūng'wīla ū Daūdi, “Ū baba būgonzo ū ntemi ni asolage shose shose īsho alītogwa kūfunya gīt'ūmo alabonele. Jiiji na nzīkū solaga ja kūfunya shitambò sha kūpemvwa, a matūlīlo ga būsīga na a majooki gakūbiza ng'hwi ja kūpemba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baba ntemi, ū Alauna alīng'winha dalali ū ntemi pyī ī shenīshi.” Ū Alauna ūng'wīla na, “Ū SEEBA Mulungu wako ni akwanukūlage ū kūlomba kwako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ntemi ūnshokeja ū Alauna, “Yaya ītī gīko, ū nene nalītogwa kūshigūla ī shikolo shenīshi ū kūfuma ū kūlī bebe. Natīko kūmfunīja shitambò ū SEEBA Mulungu wane kūfuma mu shikolo sha kwinhwa dalali. Hūna lūūlū ū Daūdi ūlūgūla ū lūbūūga lwa ng'wa Alauna nī nzīkū; ūjifunīja shekeeli makūmi atanò ja feza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
